---
import NatureLayout from '../../layouts/NatureLayout.astro';
---

<NatureLayout title="Personal" description="Soul, heart, and lineage">
  <div class="personal-wrapper">
    <!-- Who I Am Section -->
    <section class="who-am-i scroll-fade-in">
      <div class="section-content">
        <h1>Who I Am</h1>
        <p class="intro-text">
          I grew up in two worlds at once. One was Pannala—a small town in Sri Lanka where education was the only path forward. The other was everywhere else: in library books, in films, in the symbolic world of ideas and systems where I became fluent.
        </p>
        <p class="intro-text">
          I think in patterns. I feel deeply. I build ecosystems where people can breathe. I'm 23 years old, an INFJ 4W5, navigating the gap between what's real and what's possible.
        </p>
        <p class="intro-text">
          This is the personal part—the part that doesn't go in CVs. The part that explains why I think the way I do, build the way I build, and care the way I care.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Animated Water Timeline -->
    <section class="timeline-section scroll-fade-in">
      <h2>My Journey</h2>
      <div class="water-timeline">
        <svg class="water-background" viewBox="0 0 800 1000" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="waterGradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%">
              <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:#00D9D9;stop-opacity:0.3" />
              <stop offset="50%" style="stop-color:#00FF88;stop-opacity:0.2" />
              <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:#D946EF;stop-opacity:0.15" />
            </linearGradient>
            <path id="waterFlow" d="M 0,200 Q 200,150 400,200 T 800,200" />
          </defs>

          <!-- Flowing water path -->
          <path d="M 0,300 Q 200,250 400,300 T 800,300" stroke="url(#waterGradient)" stroke-width="3" fill="none" class="flow-line flow-1" />
          <path d="M 0,400 Q 200,350 400,400 T 800,400" stroke="url(#waterGradient)" stroke-width="2" fill="none" class="flow-line flow-2" opacity="0.6" />
          <path d="M 0,500 Q 200,450 400,500 T 800,500" stroke="url(#waterGradient)" stroke-width="2" fill="none" class="flow-line flow-3" opacity="0.4" />
        </svg>

        <div class="timeline-events">
          <div class="event scroll-scale" data-age="10">
            <div class="event-marker">10</div>
            <div class="event-content">
              <h3>The Library Card</h3>
              <p>Pannala public library. One book a week. Philosophy, psychology, stories. The symbolic world opened up.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="event scroll-scale" data-age="11">
            <div class="event-marker">11</div>
            <div class="event-content">
              <h3>Nalanda College & Hostel Life</h3>
              <p>Scholarship to Colombo. Living in boarding houses. I learned to carry my real home—books, ideas, systems—with me.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="event scroll-scale" data-age="18">
            <div class="event-marker">18-20</div>
            <div class="event-content">
              <h3>COVID & Film Marathon</h3>
              <p>Lockdowns. 4-5 films a day. My worldview crystallized through cinema. The existential, the philosophical, the human.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="event scroll-scale" data-age="20">
            <div class="event-marker">20</div>
            <div class="event-content">
              <h3>Axcer Innovations</h3>
              <p>Management trainee. Scrum master, finance, HR, QA, BA. I learned how systems work in practice. Then I left—couldn't ignore the pull toward something more meaningful.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="event scroll-scale" data-age="21">
            <div class="event-marker">21</div>
            <div class="event-content">
              <h3>University of Moratuwa</h3>
              <p>Business Analytics. But really, learning to build systems that serve humans. CGPA 3.3—the real education is different.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="event scroll-scale" data-age="22">
            <div class="event-marker">22</div>
            <div class="event-content">
              <h3>VP Student Union</h3>
              <p>Leadership through seeing patterns others miss. Learning what it means to serve a community.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="event scroll-scale active" data-age="23">
            <div class="event-marker">23</div>
            <div class="event-content">
              <h3>Building Gurudevi</h3>
              <p>Right now. Teacher wellbeing. EdLove ecosystem. Intuitui Labs. Where everything converges—books, films, systems thinking, care for education.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hall of Flame -->
    <section class="hall-of-flame scroll-fade-in">
      <a href="/personal/hall-of-flame" class="hall-header-link">
        <h2>Hall of Flame 🔥</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
          The innermost chamber—where memory walks like wind through fire. The people, moments, and ideas that shaped me.
        </p>
        <span class="explore-link">Explore the Hall →</span>
      </a>
      <div class="flame-chambers">
        <div class="chamber primary">
          <div class="chamber-icon">💫</div>
          <h3>Shaping Hands</h3>
          <p>People who held me steady. Family, teachers, mentors. The hands that guided when I couldn't see the path.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="chamber secondary">
          <div class="chamber-icon">📚</div>
          <h3>Sacred Texts</h3>
          <p>Books and films that opened worlds. Stories that showed me what it means to be human, to think, to care.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="chamber tertiary">
          <div class="chamber-icon">🌍</div>
          <h3>Moments of Grace</h3>
          <p>Ordinary miracles. Late night conversations. Insights in quiet rooms. The spaces where meaning happened.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="chamber accent">
          <div class="chamber-icon">🔥</div>
          <h3>Burning Questions</h3>
          <p>The questions that won't leave me. The tensions I live within. What drives my seeking, my building, my becoming.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</NatureLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  .personal-wrapper {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  // Who I Am Section
  .who-am-i {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 6rem;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-text), var(--accent-teal));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    .intro-text {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 1.5rem auto;
      color: var(--color-secondary);
      opacity: 0.95;
    }
  }

  // Timeline Section
  .timeline-section {
    margin-bottom: 8rem;

    h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .water-timeline {
      position: relative;
      padding: 2rem 0;

      .water-background {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        pointer-events: none;
        opacity: 0.3;

        .flow-line {
          animation: water-flow 8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .flow-1 {
          animation-delay: 0s;
        }

        .flow-2 {
          animation-delay: 1s;
        }

        .flow-3 {
          animation-delay: 2s;
        }
      }

      .timeline-events {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
    }

    .event {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: start;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      background: rgba(var(--accent-teal-rgb), 0.04);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-teal);
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.4s ease;

      &:hover {
        background: rgba(var(--accent-teal-rgb), 0.08);
        border-left-color: var(--accent-emerald);
        transform: translateX(8px);
      }

      &.active {
        border-left-color: var(--accent-emerald);
        background: rgba(var(--accent-emerald-rgb), 0.08);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-teal);

        .event-marker {
          background: var(--accent-emerald);
          box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(var(--accent-emerald-rgb), 0.6);
        }
      }

      .event-marker {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 70px;
        height: 70px;
        background: var(--accent-teal);
        color: white;
        border-radius: 50%;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(var(--accent-teal-rgb), 0.3);
        transition: all 0.4s ease;
      }

      .event-content {
        h3 {
          font-size: 1.3rem;
          margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
          color: var(--color-text);
        }

        p {
          font-size: 1rem;
          line-height: 1.7;
          color: var(--color-secondary);
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;
        gap: 1rem;

        .event-marker {
          width: 60px;
          height: 60px;
          font-size: 1rem;
        }
      }
    }
  }

  // Hall of Flame
  .hall-of-flame {
    margin-bottom: 6rem;

    .hall-header-link {
      display: block;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--accent-coral-rgb), 0.05), rgba(var(--accent-gold-rgb), 0.05));
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.4s ease;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;

      &::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: -50%;
        right: -50%;
        width: 200px;
        height: 200px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(var(--accent-coral-rgb), 0.15), transparent);
        border-radius: 50%;
        opacity: 0;
        transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
      }

      &:hover {
        border-color: var(--accent-coral);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--accent-coral-rgb), 0.1), rgba(var(--accent-gold-rgb), 0.08));
        transform: translateY(-4px);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(var(--accent-coral-rgb), 0.2);

        &::before {
          opacity: 1;
        }

        .explore-link {
          transform: translateX(8px);
          opacity: 1;
        }
      }
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-coral), var(--accent-gold));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .section-intro {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 1rem;
      color: var(--color-secondary);
      opacity: 0.9;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .explore-link {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent-coral);
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      opacity: 0.8;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .flame-chambers {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;

      .chamber {
        padding: 2rem;
        color: inherit;
        border-radius: 12px;
        border: 2px solid;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;

        &::before {
          content: '';
          position: absolute;
          top: -50%;
          right: -50%;
          width: 200px;
          height: 200px;
          border-radius: 50%;
          opacity: 0.3;
          z-index: 0;
        }

        .chamber-icon {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
          margin-bottom: 1rem;
          position: relative;
          z-index: 1;
        }

        h3 {
          font-size: 1.3rem;
          margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
          color: var(--color-text);
          transition: transform 0.3s ease;
          position: relative;
          z-index: 1;
        }

        p {
          font-size: 0.95rem;
          line-height: 1.6;
          color: var(--color-secondary);
          position: relative;
          z-index: 1;
        }

        &.primary {
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--accent-coral-rgb), 0.1), rgba(var(--accent-coral-rgb), 0.05));
          border-color: var(--accent-coral);

          &::before {
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(var(--accent-coral-rgb), 0.2), transparent);
          }

          &:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(var(--accent-coral-rgb), 0.15);
          }
        }

        &.secondary {
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--accent-gold-rgb), 0.1), rgba(var(--accent-gold-rgb), 0.05));
          border-color: var(--accent-gold);

          &::before {
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(var(--accent-gold-rgb), 0.2), transparent);
          }

          &:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(var(--accent-gold-rgb), 0.15);
          }
        }

        &.tertiary {
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--accent-teal-rgb), 0.1), rgba(var(--accent-teal-rgb), 0.05));
          border-color: var(--accent-teal);

          &::before {
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(var(--accent-teal-rgb), 0.2), transparent);
          }

          &:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(var(--accent-teal-rgb), 0.15);
          }
        }

        &.accent {
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--accent-emerald-rgb), 0.1), rgba(var(--accent-emerald-rgb), 0.05));
          border-color: var(--accent-emerald);

          &::before {
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(var(--accent-emerald-rgb), 0.2), transparent);
          }

          &:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(var(--accent-emerald-rgb), 0.15);
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }

  // Old Lineage Section (removed - now on Intellectual page)
  .lineage-section,
  .lineage-card,
  .lineage-branches,
  .branch {
    display: none;
  }


  // Water flow animation
  @keyframes water-flow {
    0% {
      stroke-dashoffset: 1000;
    }
    100% {
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
